      "v": 12,
      "zh": "看你们学习的工夫，本该作师傅，谁知还得有人将　神圣言小学的开端另教导你们，并且成了那必须吃奶、不能吃干粮的人。",
      "en": "For though you should in fact be teachers by this time,[NOTE:1] you need someone to teach you the beginning elements of God’s utterances.[NOTE:2] You have gone back to needing[NOTE:3] milk, not[NOTE:4] solid food.",
      "notes": [
        "Grk “because of the time.”",
        "Grk “the elements of the beginning of the oracles of God.”",
        "Grk “you have come to have a need for.”",
